{"module":"/assets/explain/method/method-homogeneous.js","part":"figure","scope":"method-homogeneous","title":"配次数：乘入值为 1 的条件式","note":"例：$x,y>0$，$x+5y=1$，求 $\\frac5x+\\frac4y$ 的最小值。目标 $-1$ 次，乘入 $1$ 次的条件式后只剩比值。","after":"fill","cases":["local"],"stylesheet":"/assets/explain/method/method-homogeneous.css","version":"2f1351e50821","html":"<div class=\"method-figure\" data-mh-panel=\"whole\">\n      <div class=\"method-template\"><span class=\"method-node\"><small>目标</small><b><var>m</var> 次</b></span><span class=\"op\">×</span><span class=\"method-node\"><small>条件式 = 1</small><b><var>n</var> 次</b></span><span class=\"method-arrow\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\">→</i></span><span class=\"method-node\"><small>0 次式</small><b><var>m</var> + <var>n</var> = 0</b></span></div>\n      <p class=\"method-demo\"><span class=\"method-demo-tag\">例</span><span class=\"method-demo-body\"><span class=\"method-demo-group\"><math><mo>(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>)</mo></math></span><span class=\"method-demo-group\"><span class=\"op\">=</span><math><mn>25</mn></math><span class=\"op\">+</span><span class=\"term square\"><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>25</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></span><span class=\"op\">+</span><span class=\"term circle\"><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></span></span></span></p>\n      <p class=\"method-pill\">只剩比值：<span class=\"nowrap\"><span class=\"mini-slot square\" aria-label=\"方框\"></span> · <span class=\"mini-slot circle\" aria-label=\"圆圈\"></span> = 100</span> 为定值</p>\n    </div>"}
